格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) for JetBrains IDEs — AI coding with native diffs, tool approvals, sessions, Trace analysis, and balance tracking. | IntelliJ IDEA / PyCharm AI 编程助手：原生 Diff、工具审批、会话与 Trace 分析。","id":"gh:1350422870","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-intellij-integration","slug":"HarcoChen/dsh-intellij-integration","topics":["ai-agent","ai-coding-assistant","code-review","coding-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","intellij","intellij-plugin","jetbrains","pycharm"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) for JetBrains IDEs — AI coding with native diffs, tool approvals, sessions, T"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"race analysis, and balance tracking. | IntelliJ IDEA / PyCharm AI 编程助手：原生 Diff、工具审批、会话与 Trace 分析。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness for JetBrains IDEs"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Bring DeepSeek Harness into JetBrains IDEs — chat with your code, review native diffs, and inspect e"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"pSeek Harness into JetBrains IDEs — chat with your code, review native diffs, and inspect every run."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Install plugin ·\nReleases ·\nFeedback ·\nVS Code edition"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"An independent community plugin for IntelliJ IDEA, PyCharm, and other IntelliJ Platform IDEs. Explai"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"n unfamiliar code, investigate a bug, or review a change from the same place you write it."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"1. **Install** — in **Settings → Plugins → Marketplace**, search for **DeepSeek Harness Integration*"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"*, or open the Marketplace page. Restart the IDE if prompted.\n2. **Connect** — open a project and th"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"e **DSH** tool window. The plugin discovers a compatible local `dsh`, including the command register"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ed by the official DeepSeek Desktop app; the bundled lifecycle helper still needs Node.js 24+. The p"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"lugin starts the Runtime automatically by default. Configure the launch command or an existing Runti"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"me's **Server URL** in **Settings → Tools → DeepSeek Harness**.\n3. **Configure credentials** — find "},{"id":"p8s7","text":"**DSH: Configure API Key** via **Find Action**. Restart the local Runtime after changing the key so "},{"id":"p8s8","text":"it receives the new value. An existing external Runtime uses its own credentials.\n4. **Try it** — se"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"lect a function, right-click **DSH → Explain Selection**, or ask a question in the chat. Inspect too"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"l cards and proposed diffs when an approval is requested."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Requires:** IntelliJ Platform **2024.3+** with JCEF (the embedded browser). The build targets Inte"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"lliJ IDEA Community and PyCharm Community 2024.3.6 for compatibility verification. Other IntelliJ Pl"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"atform IDEs need the same platform APIs and JCEF support."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## From question to reviewed change"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| What you want to do | What DSH brings into your IDE |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Understand or improve code | Explain, fix, review, and document selected code from the editor's co"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ntext menu. |\n| Inspect an agent's edits | Open supported tool diff cards in JetBrains' native side-"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"by-side viewer, including proposed changes awaiting approval. |\n| Keep track of a task | Chat histor"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"y, session switching, tool cards, and runtime status in the DSH tool window. |\n| Understand a run | "},{"id":"p12s5","text":"Built-in Trace analysis for inspecting session events and tool activity. |\n| Watch usage | A status-"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"bar balance indicator with DeepSeek pricing information when available. |\n| Resume across editors | "},{"id":"p12s7","text":"Reuse a compatible local Harness Runtime across IDE windows and the companion VS Code extension. |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Native diffs, even without Git"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Review file edits in the IDE's own diff viewer. For supported tool diff cards, DSH reconstructs befo"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"re/after content from session history, so the preview does not depend on a Git repository. Proposed "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"edits can be previewed before approval. If later file changes make reconstruction unreliable, the pl"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ugin reports that instead of showing a misleading comparison."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Before an approval can release a structured file edit, DSH checks IntelliJ's unsaved editor buffers "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"against the proposed paths. Overlapping edits keep the approval pending until you save or revert the"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"e proposed paths. Overlapping edits keep the approval pending until you save or revert the document."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Put the right context into the conversation"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Use **DSH: Ask About Selection** for an open-ended question, or the **DSH** context menu for explain"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" / fix / review / documentation tasks. The context picker also supports attaching the current unstag"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ed Git diff. Editor context is bounded by the configurable byte limit."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The composer accepts files pasted from the clipboard, dropped from the desktop, or chosen with the f"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ile picker. Files are uploaded to the connected Runtime and represented in the prompt by session-sco"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ped receipts; the host never sends a client file path to the model. Use the copy button on a user or"},{"id":"p18s4","text":" assistant message to place its text on the system clipboard."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Use the `/template` slash command to choose a bounded Markdown draft from `.dsh/prompts` and place i"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"t in the composer. The template is visible and editable; it is never sent until you submit it."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The native **Conversation Outline** command jumps to a selected turn. Finalized assistant messages a"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"lso expose optional Runtime-backed feedback controls (rating, note, and session feedback); older Run"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"times hide the controls without affecting chat. From a finalized message you can fork the session, r"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"estore that turn's code changes, or do both after the host revalidates the checkpoint."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Plan before implementing"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Use the composer's **Plan** toggle or `/plan` to enter plan mode; `/plan off` leaves it.\nThe toggle "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"changes the session mode without sending a task or consuming attached IDE context.\nWhen the agent su"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"bmits a plan for review, approve it or provide feedback with **Continue planning**.\nThe subagent tre"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"e and preview show active and completed execution time when the Runtime supplies it."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The Activity Dock also shows validated active reminders and, when the Runtime exposes them, a\nread-o"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"nly plugin inventory and dynamic Cordis plugin state. Dynamic plugin stop/remove/decline\nactions are"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" host-validated; the IDE never executes an untrusted Client-half plugin."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Chat and debug from the editor"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Use **DSH: Open Chat in Editor Tab** from Find Action or the chat menu. The tab mirrors\nits tool win"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"dow: both share the selected Session, messages, controls and Runtime.\nClosing a tab releases its vie"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"w. Question drafts are saved in the project's local\nIDE settings, including across IDE restarts; idl"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"e views do not overwrite edits."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Enable **Allow Agent to control this IDE debugger** in plugin settings, then restart\nits locally own"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ed Runtime. The Agent can start an existing Run/Debug configuration,\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Data use and privacy"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The plugin does not collect telemetry. Prompts and attached context are sent through the DSH Runtime"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" to your configured model provider; that provider's terms and privacy policy apply. API keys stored "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"by the plugin remain in IntelliJ Password Safe and are passed to newly started local Runtime process"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"the plugin remain in IntelliJ Password Safe and are passed to newly started local Runtime processes."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

